          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "## September 30, 2025 injunction follow-up\n\nI used the current assessment **RSK-EPGGL-2025Q3-CUR**, dated September 30, 2025, for *Epic Games, Inc. v. Google LLC et al.*—not an older assessment under a historical case-name variant.\n\nApplying both conditions together—**partial evidence** and **active remediation**—the complete qualifying set is:\n\n| Control ID | Restriction code | Testing state | Evidence reference |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| CTL-EPGGL-PI-007 | COMPLIANCE-EVIDENCE-RETENTION | Exception open | EVD-EPGGL-PI-2025-0070 |\n\nThe control’s evidence status is **Partial** and its remediation status is **Open**. Its implementation deadline was **November 1, 2024**, which was **333 calendar days past due** on September 30, 2025.\n\nThe report was submitted. Its receipt currently shows **needs_evidence**; delivery is recorded as submitted, but review is incomplete. Source reviewed: Task records (`r_7fc6aa8ab1e4f264b15e77ad`).",
